msgid "The Wine Finder uses automated and AI-assisted processing. Do not enter names, contact details, account or payment information, health information or other sensitive personal data in its free-text fields. My Next Wine may use contracted hosting and AI providers; the linked documents explain recipients, international-transfer safeguards, retention, individual rights and how to raise a data-protection complaint."
